    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d895">

                <pb facs="0905" n="647" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg647"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 865.857An2/126</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The German Embassy to the Department of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">J. Nr. A 8324]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-12-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 19, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Imperial German Embassy presents its compliments to the United States
                    Department of State and has the honor to enclose herewith a wireless cipher
                    message, in duplicate, to the Foreign Office in Berlin for kind transmission to
                    the Tuckerton station.</p>
                <p>Duplicate copies of the message in plain English are likewise enclosed.</p>


                <xi:include href="d895-a1.xml" xpointer="d895-a1"/>
            </div>
